{
  "id": "agentstack-labs/linear",
  "version": "0.3.0",
  "name": "Linear Project Management",
  "description": "Linear integration for RailCall — manage issues, projects, teams, cycles, labels, webhooks, and initiatives through governed workflows.\n\n45 airlock-governed commands. Read operations execute instantly. Write operations require human approval before execution, with signed receipts for full audit trail.\n\n## What it does\n\n- Issues: create, update, delete, archive, search, bulk update, link\n- Projects: create, update, status updates with health signals\n- Teams and users: list, get\n- Workflow states and labels: create, update\n- Cycles: create, update, list\n- Comments: create, update, delete\n- Webhooks: create, update, delete\n- Milestones: create, update, list\n- Initiatives: create, update, link projects, post status updates\n\n## Key features\n\n- Linear-native identifiers (`ENG-123`) — no UUID lookup required\n- Full-text search across titles, descriptions, and comments\n- Batch operations with partial-failure reporting\n- All credentials stored in station vault — never logged or written to disk\n- Signed Ed25519 receipts for every action\n\n## Setup\n\nOpen `railcall studio` → **Sends** → **Linear — API key + team**. Paste a key from [Linear API settings](https://linear.app/settings/api).\n\n- **Single-team workspace:** Team ID is auto-detected. Just paste the API key.\n- **Multi-team workspace:** Team ID is required. You can pass a team name (e.g. `team_id: Backend`) instead of a UUID.\n\n## Limitations\n\n- Issue commands accept `ENG-123` format; other resources require IDs\n- Milestones must be scoped to a project\n- API key auth only — no OAuth\n\nMIT licensed. [Source](https://github.com/faizalmy/railcall-linear-module)\n\ncontest:2026Q3",
  "author": "AgentStack Labs — RailCall modules for engineering workflow tooling",
  "license": "MIT",
  "publisher_pubkey": "a02b37627cdf4e585c6e72e8335ff299c9d8a3e0720281c76efbb9d06fac3959",
  "category": "Eng",
  "tags": [
    "project-management",
    "issue-tracker",
    "linear",
    "productivity",
    "team-collaboration"
  ],
